---
---

<!-- The Problem -->
<section class="relative py-28 sm:py-36 px-6 bg-golden-hour">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
    <div class="reveal">
      <h2 class="font-wander text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl text-earth mb-8 leading-snug">
        Your phone wasn't designed<br class="hidden sm:block" /> to let you go.
      </h2>
    </div>
    <div class="reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.15s;">
      <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-cocoa/85 leading-relaxed max-w-xl mx-auto font-light">
        Five hours a day. 144 unlocks. The reach is automatic — your thumb moves before you've decided.
        You don't need another lock. You need someone to gently say:
        <em class="font-dear text-xl sm:text-2xl text-earth/80 block mt-4" style="font-style: italic;">"Dear Wander, let's stay here a moment."</em>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- How It Works -->
<section class="relative py-28 sm:py-36 px-6 bg-golden-mid" id="how-it-works">
  <!-- Decorative petals -->
  <div class="petal w-20 h-24 top-16 right-[10%] opacity-25" style="animation: drift 20s ease-in-out infinite;"></div>
  <div class="petal w-14 h-18 bottom-20 left-[8%] opacity-20" style="animation: drift-alt 24s ease-in-out infinite; animation-delay: -5s;"></div>

  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-16 reveal">
      <h2 class="font-wander text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-earth mb-4">How it works</h2>
      <p class="text-taupe text-lg font-light">Three moments. One gentle interruption.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 sm:gap-8">
      <!-- The Pause -->
      <div class="glass p-8 sm:p-10 reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.1s;">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-breath/20 flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="text-earth">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.6"/>
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.4"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-wander text-xl text-earth mb-3">The Pause</h3>
        <p class="text-cocoa/80 leading-relaxed font-light">
          You reach for Instagram. A warm screen appears — amber light, soft breathing cues.
          Sixty seconds of guided presence before you scroll.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- The Wander -->
      <div class="glass p-8 sm:p-10 reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.25s;">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-breath/20 flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="text-earth">
            <path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.6"/>
            <path d="M12 6v6l4.5 2.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" opacity="0.5"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-wander text-xl text-earth mb-3">The Wander</h3>
        <p class="text-cocoa/80 leading-relaxed font-light">
          You earned your access. Ten minutes — they're yours. A gentle amber arc tracks the time,
          never counting down, just glowing softly.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Come Home -->
      <div class="glass p-8 sm:p-10 reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.4s;">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-breath/20 flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="text-earth">
            <path d="M3 12l9-8 9 8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" opacity="0.5"/>
            <path d="M5 10v9a1 1 0 001 1h12a1 1 0 001-1v-9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.6"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-wander text-xl text-earth mb-3">Come Home</h3>
        <p class="text-cocoa/80 leading-relaxed font-light">
          <em class="font-dear" style="font-style: italic;">"Almost time to come home."</em>
          Not an alarm. Not a lock. A letter, arriving softly at the edge of your attention.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- First Light & Last Light -->
<section class="relative py-28 sm:py-36 px-6 bg-golden-hour overflow-hidden">
  <div class="petal w-24 h-30 top-[20%] left-[5%] opacity-20" style="animation: drift-alt 26s ease-in-out infinite;"></div>

  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-16 reveal">
      <h2 class="font-wander text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-earth mb-4">Two rituals. One golden hour.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
      <!-- First Light -->
      <div class="glass p-10 sm:p-12 text-center reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.1s;">
        <div
          class="w-20 h-20 rounded-full mx-auto mb-6"
          style="background: radial-gradient(circle, #FCEABB 0%, #F4A85A 60%, transparent 100%); opacity: 0.7;"
        ></div>
        <h3 class="font-wander text-2xl text-earth mb-2">First Light</h3>
        <p class="font-dear text-lg text-taupe mb-4" style="font-style: italic;">The morning pause</p>
        <p class="text-cocoa/80 font-light leading-relaxed">
          Before the world rushes in — a moment to arrive in your own day.
          Warmer gradients, a slightly faster breath. The sun is rising. So are you.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Last Light -->
      <div class="glass-dark p-10 sm:p-12 text-center reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.25s;">
        <div
          class="w-20 h-20 rounded-full mx-auto mb-6"
          style="background: radial-gradient(circle, #F4A85A 0%, #5C4E7A 70%, transparent 100%); opacity: 0.6;"
        ></div>
        <h3 class="font-wander text-2xl text-warm-white mb-2">Last Light</h3>
        <p class="font-dear text-lg text-warm-white/60 mb-4" style="font-style: italic;">The evening return</p>
        <p class="text-warm-white/75 font-light leading-relaxed">
          The day is completing. A slower breath, deeper amber, the soft edges of twilight.
          Put the phone down gently. You've done enough.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- What makes us different -->
<section class="relative py-28 sm:py-36 px-6 bg-golden-deep text-warm-white overflow-hidden">
  <div class="petal w-20 h-24 top-[15%] right-[8%] opacity-10" style="animation: drift 22s ease-in-out infinite; border-color: rgba(252, 234, 187, 0.08);"></div>

  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
    <div class="reveal">
      <h2 class="font-wander text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-warm-white mb-6 leading-snug">
        Not a blocker. Not a timer.<br />
        <span class="font-dear text-4xl sm:text-5xl" style="font-style: italic;">A moment of beauty<br />before you scroll.</span>
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mt-16">
      <div class="reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.1s;">
        <div class="text-3xl mb-4 opacity-70">&#10047;</div>
        <h3 class="font-wander text-lg text-warm-white mb-2">Native iOS</h3>
        <p class="text-warm-white/60 font-light text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Built on Apple's own FamilyControls API. No VPN. No Shortcuts hacks. No battery drain.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.25s;">
        <div class="text-3xl mb-4 opacity-70">&#9670;</div>
        <h3 class="font-wander text-lg text-warm-white mb-2">Completely private</h3>
        <p class="text-warm-white/60 font-light text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Your data never leaves your device. No accounts. No tracking. Just you and your breath.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.4s;">
        <div class="text-3xl mb-4 opacity-70">&#9825;</div>
        <h3 class="font-wander text-lg text-warm-white mb-2">Never punitive</h3>
        <p class="text-warm-white/60 font-light text-sm leading-relaxed">
          No shame metrics. No "you failed" messages. Only warmth, only letters, only presence.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Testimonial / Social proof -->
<section class="relative py-28 sm:py-36 px-6 bg-golden-hour">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-16 reveal">
      <p class="font-dear text-xl text-taupe" style="font-style: italic;">What people are saying</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
      <div class="glass p-8 reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.1s;">
        <p class="text-cocoa/85 font-light leading-relaxed mb-4">
          "I've tried every screen time app. They all felt like punishment. Dear Wander is the first one
          that felt like a gift."
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm text-taupe font-medium">— Early beta tester</p>
      </div>
      <div class="glass p-8 reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.25s;">
        <p class="text-cocoa/85 font-light leading-relaxed mb-4">
          "The breathing screen is so beautiful I sometimes open my phone just to see it.
          Which is... kind of the whole point?"
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm text-taupe font-medium">— Early beta tester</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
